d in Europe as a whole â€“ especially when compared to its widespread adoption in the US. Legacy newspapers , bloggers and even Elon Musk have all weighed in on â€œ European hostility â€ to AC, criticising Europeâ€™s â€œ cultural conservatism â€ and â€œ overbearing governments â€. Right-wing politicians, includin...","[3] Train crew in Canada 'encased' by intense flames amid wildfires - video (theguardian.com, Thu, 16 Jul 2026 01:37:13 GMT) - <p>Video <a href=\"https://x.com/solmamakwa/status/2077164640790892548\">footage of a train</a> near the community of Armstrong, Ontario, highlights the speed and ferocity of one of more than 100 wildfires currently burning in Canada. 'This could potentially overtake us here â€¦ This has gotten a little scary,' says a crew member as a wall of flames whips across the windows. 'Weâ€™re encased in flames now.' The railway company Canadian National confirmed the crew has been 'safely evacuated' from the area</p><p></p><ul><li><p><a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/world/2026/jul/15/wildfires-in-ontario-make-toronto-canada-air-quality-worst-in-world\">Wildfires in Ontario make Toronto air quality wo...","[4] A Bay Area financial analyst wants a piece of this mineral-rich seabed surrounded by 3 Pacific nations (grist.org, Wed, 15 Jul 2026 08:30:00 +0000) - Last summer, at the United Nations Ocean Conference, French Polynesia established the worldâ€™s largest contiguous marine protected area, reinforcing its 2022 ban on seabed mining. â€œThe deep sea is not for sale,â€ Franceâ€™s president, Emmanuel Macron, said at the time.&nbsp; A year later, that might not hold true for the waters just beyond French Polynesiaâ€™s maritime border. A little-known American startup is seeking the Trump administrationâ€™s approval to lease 25 million acres of international waters for mining exploration just outside the areas over which French Polynesia, the Cook Islands, and Kiribati have exclusive rights. The area, called Eastern High Seas Pocket